"bloomberg-markets", "title": "Asian Stocks Ride Tech Rally Higher as Oil Drops: Markets Wrap", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-09/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates", "excerpt": "Asian stocks headed for their biggest two-day advance in more than three months, boosted by a tech rally and a further decline in oil prices.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T22:16:53.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "China Oil Imports Rebound as More Crude Flows From Persian Gulf", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-10/china-oil-imports-rebound-as-more-crude-flows-from-persian-gulf", "excerpt": "Chinese crude oil imports rose to a seven-month high in October on a recovery in shipments from the Persian Gulf.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T03:42:53.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "中国10月原油进口量升至七个月高位，主要因来自波斯湾的原油装运量回升。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Rising Fuel Flows Through Hormuz May Help Ease Strained Market", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-10/rising-fuel-flows-through-hormuz-may-help-ease-strained-market", "excerpt": "The volume of refined products being loaded within the Persian Gulf is rising, with most of that exiting the Strait of Hormuz and providing some relief to one of the tightest corners of the global oil market nine months into the Iran war.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T03:39:50.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "波斯湾内装载的成品油数量上升，其中大部分经霍尔木兹海峡运出，为全球石油市场最紧张的一环提供一定缓解。此时伊朗战争已持续九个月。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Copper Extends Rebound as Global Technology Stocks Resume Rally", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-10/copper-extends-rebound-as-global-technology-stocks-resume-rally", "excerpt": "Copper extended its rebound from last week’s slump, tracking a rally in technology shares due to the metal’s use in power infrastructure and data centers.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T03:04:14.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "铜价延续上周暴跌后的反弹，跟随全球科技股回升。铜用于电力基础设施和数据中心，与科技板块走势关联紧密。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Hegseth Hits Out at Critics as Massie Pushes Impeachment", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-10/hegseth-hits-out-at-critics-as-massie-pushes-impeachment-video", "excerpt": "President Donald Trump and Secretary of State Marco Rubio defended Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth after Republican representative Thomas Massie introduced articles of impeachment over military operations in Iran. Hegseth has rejected calls to step down, characterizing the effort as politically motiv", "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T02:49:21.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "美国共和党众议员托马斯·马西就伊朗军事行动提出弹劾条款后，总统特朗普与国务卿鲁比奥为国防部长赫格塞思辩护。赫格塞思拒绝辞职呼声，并抨击批评者。"}], "overview": "今日最大变量来自英伟达：黄仁勋承认婚外情，涉事女子被指为中国情报人员，公司董事会启动调查，股价大跌并抹去数千亿美元市值，特朗普称FBI已介入，事件同时波及中美关系与AI板块情绪。科技侧，Anthropic开源Agent Skills技能库、Meta发布设计系统astryx，OpenAI上线Control Room模型工作负载熔断机制，智能体安全与治理成为显性议题。财经侧，中国10月原油进口回升至七个月高位，日本30年国债拍卖需求疲软，铜价随科技股反弹，澳洲航空宣布外包850个岗位至印度。时政侧，美方称对伊朗进一步打击「可能性很低」，乌克兰和平谈判本周在阿布扎比重启。", "market": {"market_overview": "美股方面，大型科技股技术面分化明显：MSFT 触发 MACD 金叉且近五日上涨 7.51%，AAPL 站在 SMA20/50/200 之上并逼近 52 周高，而 NVDA 单日重挫 4.27%、RSI14 跌至 27.4 进入超卖，GOOGL 出现 SMA50 下穿 SMA200 的死叉；SPY 与 QQQ 当日分别反弹 2.37%、3.54%，但二者价格仍低于 SMA20 与 SMA50，RSI14 分别为 45.8 与 41.4，指数层面仅属超跌反抽。加密方面，恐慌贪婪指数 32（恐慌），总市值 2.51 万亿美元、24 小时 -1.77%，BTC 主导率 59.6%、ETH 10.3%；BTC 现价 74597.7 低于 SMA20/50、RSI14 35.4，ETH 五日跌 12.67%、RSI14 32.6 并触发 MACD 死叉，SOL RSI14 26.3 进入超卖。中概股中 JD 五日涨 7.91%、RSI14 63.1，BABA 与 0700.HK 虽现 MACD 金叉或 RSI 中性，但仍处空头排列。商品外汇方面，黄金五日涨 4.64% 却仍在 SMA50/200 下方，WTI 原油五日跌 10.66% 且 RSI14 36.7，美元指数 101.68 呈多头排列并逼近 52 周高，USDCNY 出现 MACD 金叉但维持空头排列；VIX 单日暴跌 22.31% 至 19.92，10Y 美债收益率 4.86、RSI14 37.5。", "watchlist": [{"symbol": "NVDA", "display_name": "英伟达 (NVDA)", "stance": "偏下行", "rationale": "现价 178.67 美元，单日下跌 4